      "writtenOn": "2022-03-30T13:50:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This command will compile the debugger cc_library and enforce IWYU\n\nbazelisk build //tools/debugger --config\u003dclang --gpu_backend\u003dgl_backend --features skia_enforce_iwyu\n\n(the --features part is what turns on the enforcement or not)\nIf it finds something amiss, it will print an error message like:\nhttp://go/paste/5885104325918720",
