      "message": "Was this autogenerated?  Is the policy to always prefer forward declarations over includes in headers?\n\nI understand how this is optimal for faster compilation, but as a developer I would need this process to come behind me,  like clang-format, and turn my includes into forward declarations since I\u0027m pretty sure I won\u0027t remember when I\u0027m writing code.",
