      "writtenOn": "2022-03-30T13:44:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I believe the policy is to prefer forward declarations where possible.\n\nAll changes in //tools/debugger were automatically generated by the IWYU tool that is in the Bazel toolchain. I just copied and pasted it into the file and added some newlines to separate the blocks.\n\nThe other changes were manual after compilation broke because those files weren\u0027t including what they needed.\n\nIf there was a change, the appropriate diff would show up in the error message from the CQ/CI job.",
      "parentUuid": "ff4df418_2f5159f7",
